{"id":"HAD-0286","recordType":"hadith","language":"de","narratorLine":"Abū Salamah berichtete:","speakerLabel":"ʿĀʾishah رضي الله عنها sagte:","textMarkdown":"Ja, der Prophet ﷺ schlief im Zustand der Janābah, aber er verrichtete zuvor **Wuḍūʾ**.","source":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī, Nr. 286","grade":"Ṣaḥīḥ","verificationNote":"Ṣaḥīḥ al-Buḫārī; authentische Sammlung."}